#!/bin/bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
OmixOS system updates are NixOS generation updates; the Omarchy Pacman update pipeline is disabled.

From the OmixOS flake checkout, run:
  nix flake update
  sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#<host>

For a remote Pi 4, run:
  sudo nixos-rebuild switch --flake .#pi4 --target-host <user>@<pi-host>

Review docs/pi4.md and docs/compatibility.md before updating.
EOF
